hub_title:"Everything a student needs — in one place",hub_sub:"Exam prep: quizzes, flashcards, exam tickets, smart review, duels with friends and handy tools. All free.",hub_tests:"Quizzes and exam prep",hub_tests_d:"Ready quizzes, upload your own bank, flashcards and exam tickets",hub_tools:"Tools",hub_tools_d:"Score and GPA calculators, exam calendar, Pomodoro",hub_about_d:"Rules, privacy, contact",find_title:"Search quizzes",find_sub:"Type a subject — e.g. “history”, “math”, “C++”.",find_ph:"Search subjects or quizzes…",find_none:"Nothing found. Upload your own bank below.",find_more:"All quizzes →",about_link:"About",about_html:"<p><b>Sessiya+</b> is a free exam-prep platform for students in Azerbaijan: quizzes, flashcards, exam tickets, smart review, duels with friends, score and GPA calculators.</p><h3>How it works</h3><p>Sign in with Google or email. Find ready quizzes in “Quizzes” or upload your own bank (PDF, Word, text) — the site turns it into an interactive quiz; for tricky files, AI recognises the structure. If you like, add your quiz to the shared catalog for everyone.</p><h3>Privacy</h3><p>We only store your account name and email. Files are read in your browser; if you choose “Recognise with AI”, the file's text is sent to Google Gemini for processing. Only questions you choose to add go to the catalog. Your progress is saved to your account so you can continue on any device. You can delete your account at any time in “Profile”.</p><h3>Rules</h3><p>Spam, insults, other people's personal data and copyright-infringing material are not allowed in the catalog. Report them with the “Report” button and they will be removed.</p><h3>About the quizzes</h3><p>Ready-made quizzes are samples written by Sessiya+ and do not replace official university banks. AI-written answers can contain mistakes — double-check. Banks added by students are their authors' responsibility.</p><p class=\"note\">Sessiya+ is not affiliated with any university.</p>",
